<!-- ── OUR STORY ── -->
<section class="about-story">
    <div class="about-story-grid">
        <div class="about-story-visual">
            <div class="about-logo-frame">
                <img src="/images/icons/logo_black name.svg" alt="Qualitick Collections" class="about-logo">
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="about-story-text">
            <h2 class="about-section-title">Our Story</h2>
            <p>Qualitick Collections is a Zambian based retail business specializing in the sale of watches and lifestyle accessories through online platforms. We operate primarily via our website and social media channels, including Facebook, Instagram, and WhatsApp, serving customers across Zambia.</p>
            <p>Our services include the retail of wristwatches and related accessories, with a focus on providing quality, stylish, and affordable products. We offer both full upfront payment options and structured payment plans such as installment and layby arrangements. These payment options allow customers to make an initial deposit followed by scheduled payments under clearly defined terms.</p>
            <p>Orders are placed online or through direct communication channels, after which customers receive confirmation and payment instructions. Once payment is completed (or deposit is made in the case of installment plans), orders are processed and delivered using reliable courier and local delivery services across Zambia.</p>
            <p>Our target market includes individuals aged 18–55 within Zambia who are interested in fashion accessories, particularly those seeking flexible purchasing options for quality products. We are committed to transparent pricing, secure transaction handling, and timely delivery. Customer support is provided through WhatsApp, email, and social media to ensure clear communication throughout the purchasing process.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

